which *trans* is curtailed to *tran* when it is prefixed to a word of English & not Latin origin like *ship*. The full & indisputably better form *trans-ship* is accordingly here recommended; but the OED accepts *tranship*, saying only 'less commonly trans-ship'.
>>>

